concept:federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6A Effect of change of name of Federal Magistrates Court"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-6a ;
    values:originalText "To the extent that this Part applies after the commencement of Schedule 2 to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Legislation Amendment Act 2012:  (a) a reference in this Part to the Federal Magistrates Act 1999 is taken to include a reference to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Act 1999; and  (b) a reference in this Part to the Federal Magistrates Court is taken to include a reference to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia." ;
    skos:definition "To the extent that this Part applies after the commencement of Schedule 2 to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Legislation Amendment Act 2012:  (a) a reference in this Part to the Federal Magistrates Act 1999 is taken to include a reference to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Act 1999; and  (b) a reference in this Part to the Federal Magistrates Court is taken to include a reference to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia."@en ;
