concept:federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013-sch-1-sec-11-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11 Effect of change of name of Federal Magistrates Court"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-11-2 ;
    values:originalText "Schedule 1  Main amendments  To the extent that this Schedule applies after the commencement of Schedule 2 to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Legislation Amendment Act 2012:  (a) a reference in this Schedule to the Federal Magistrates Act 1999 is taken to include a reference to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Act 1999; and  (b) a reference in this Schedule to a Federal Magistrate is taken to include a reference to a Judge of the Federal Circuit Court of Australia; and  (c) a reference in this Schedule to the Federal Magistrates Court is taken to include a reference to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia. Federal Court of Australia Act 1976" ;
    skos:definition "Schedule 1  Main amendments  To the extent that this Schedule applies after the commencement of Schedule 2 to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Legislation Amendment Act 2012:  (a) a reference in this Schedule to the Federal Magistrates Act 1999 is taken to include a reference to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Act 1999; and  (b) a reference in this Schedule to a Federal Magistrate is taken to include a reference to a Judge of the Federal Circuit Court of Australia; and  (c) a reference in this Schedule to the Federal Magistrates Court is taken to include a reference to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia. Federal Court of Australia Act 1976"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "45ca9281b5b6cbf1ee16ba7b3b54446e00c2700e276d76e7894b838e85c4b92a" ;
