    cml:operator "Applicable" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Obligation" ;
    cml:premiseText "a reference in this Schedule to the Federal Magistrates Act 1999 is taken to include a reference to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Act 1999" ;
    cml:conclusionText "the effect of change of name of Federal Magistrates Court imposes an obligation on the parties affected" ;
