doc:sch-1-sec-11-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "11 Effect of change of name of Federal Magistrates Court" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Schedule 1  Main amendments  To the extent that this Schedule applies after the commencement of Schedule 2 to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Legislation Amendment Act 2012:  (a) a reference in this Schedule to the Federal Magistrates Act 1999 is taken to include a reference to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Act 1999; and  (b) a reference in this Schedule to a Federal Magistrate is taken to include a reference to a Judge of the Federal Circuit Court of Australia; and  (c) a reference in this Schedule to the Federal Magistrates Court is taken to include a reference to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia. Federal Court of Australia Act 1976" ;
    cof:pageNumber "55"^^xsd:integer .

