concept:federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013-sch-1-sec-320 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "320 Saving provision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-320 ;
    values:originalText "Schedule 1  Main amendments  A thing done by, or in relation to, a Federal Magistrate, as an issuing officer, under the Greenhouse and Energy Minimum Standards Act 2012 before the commencement of this item has effect, after that commencement, as if it had been done by, or in relation to, a Judge of the Federal Circuit Court of Australia, as an issuing officer, under that Act. Independent Contractors Act 2006" ;
    skos:definition "Schedule 1  Main amendments  A thing done by, or in relation to, a Federal Magistrate, as an issuing officer, under the Greenhouse and Energy Minimum Standards Act 2012 before the commencement of this item has effect, after that commencement, as if it had been done by, or in relation to, a Judge of the Federal Circuit Court of Australia, as an issuing officer, under that Act. Independent Contractors Act 2006"@en ;
