    values:originalText "A thing done by, or in relation to, a Federal Magistrate, as an issuing officer, under the Law Enforcement Integrity Commissioner Act 2006 before the commencement of this item has effect, after that commencement, as if it had been done by, or in relation to, a Judge of the Federal Circuit Court of Australia, as an issuing officer, under that Act. Marriage Act 1961" ;
