    values:originalText "Insert: issuing officer means:  (a) a magistrate; or  (b) a Judge of the Federal Circuit Court of Australia in respect of whom a consent under subsection 87(1) and a nomination under subsection 87(2) are in force." ;
    cof:pageNumber "75"^^xsd:integer .

