    values:originalText "item 187 At the same time as the provision(s) covered by table item 2. However, the provision(s) do not commence at all if item 6 of Schedule 2 to the Access to Justice (Federal Jurisdiction) Amendment Act 2012 commences at or before the time the provision(s) covered by table item 2 commence." ;
