concept:federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013-sch-4-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 Transitional regulations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "The Governor-General may make regulations prescribing matters of a transitional nature (including prescribing any saving or application provisions) relating to the amendments and repeals made by Schedules 1, 2 and 3." ;
